042601             0169*   ; formats: https://agonconsole8.github.io/agon-docs/VDP---Bitmaps-API.html
042601             0170*   ; 0 	RGBA8888 (4-bytes per pixel)
042601             0171*   ; 1 	RGBA2222 (1-bytes per pixel)
042601             0172*   ; 2 	Mono/Mask (1-bit per pixel)
